include/stb-master/deprecated/stb.h://////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
include/stb-master/deprecated/stb.h://
include/stb-master/deprecated/stb.h://             STB-C sliding-window dictionary compression
include/stb-master/deprecated/stb.h://
include/stb-master/deprecated/stb.h://  This uses a DEFLATE-style sliding window, but no bitwise entropy.
include/stb-master/deprecated/stb.h://  Everything is on byte boundaries, so you could then apply a byte-wise
include/stb-master/deprecated/stb.h://  entropy code, though that's nowhere near as effective.
include/stb-master/deprecated/stb.h://
include/stb-master/deprecated/stb.h://  An STB-C stream begins with a 16-byte header:
include/stb-master/deprecated/stb.h://      4 bytes: 0x57 0xBC 0x00 0x00
include/stb-master/deprecated/stb.h://      8 bytes: big-endian size of decompressed data, 64-bits
include/stb-master/deprecated/stb.h://      4 bytes: big-endian size of window (how far back decompressor may need)
include/stb-master/deprecated/stb.h://
include/stb-master/deprecated/stb.h://  The following symbols appear in the stream (these were determined ad hoc,
include/stb-master/deprecated/stb.h://  not by analysis):
include/stb-master/deprecated/stb.h://
include/stb-master/deprecated/stb.h://  [dict]      00000100 yyyyyyyy yyyyyyyy yyyyyyyy xxxxxxxx xxxxxxxx
include/stb-master/deprecated/stb.h://  [END]       00000101 11111010 cccccccc cccccccc cccccccc cccccccc
include/stb-master/deprecated/stb.h://  [dict]      00000110 yyyyyyyy yyyyyyyy yyyyyyyy xxxxxxxx
include/stb-master/deprecated/stb.h://  [literals]  00000111 zzzzzzzz zzzzzzzz
include/stb-master/deprecated/stb.h://  [literals]  00001zzz zzzzzzzz
include/stb-master/deprecated/stb.h://  [dict]      00010yyy yyyyyyyy yyyyyyyy xxxxxxxx xxxxxxxx
include/stb-master/deprecated/stb.h://  [dict]      00011yyy yyyyyyyy yyyyyyyy xxxxxxxx
include/stb-master/deprecated/stb.h://  [literals]  001zzzzz
include/stb-master/deprecated/stb.h://  [dict]      01yyyyyy yyyyyyyy xxxxxxxx
include/stb-master/deprecated/stb.h://  [dict]      1xxxxxxx yyyyyyyy
include/stb-master/deprecated/stb.h://
include/stb-master/deprecated/stb.h://      xxxxxxxx: match length - 1
include/stb-master/deprecated/stb.h://      yyyyyyyy: backwards distance - 1
include/stb-master/deprecated/stb.h://      zzzzzzzz: num literals - 1
include/stb-master/deprecated/stb.h://      cccccccc: adler32 checksum of decompressed data
include/stb-master/deprecated/stb.h://   (all big-endian)
