include/stb-master/deprecated/stb_image_resize.h:/* stb_image_resize - v0.97 - public domain image resizing
include/stb-master/deprecated/stb_image_resize.h:   by Jorge L Rodriguez (@VinoBS) - 2014
include/stb-master/deprecated/stb_image_resize.h:   http://github.com/nothings/stb
include/stb-master/deprecated/stb_image_resize.h:
include/stb-master/deprecated/stb_image_resize.h:   Written with emphasis on usability, portability, and efficiency. (No
include/stb-master/deprecated/stb_image_resize.h:   SIMD or threads, so it be easily outperformed by libs that use those.)
include/stb-master/deprecated/stb_image_resize.h:   Only scaling and translation is supported, no rotations or shears.
include/stb-master/deprecated/stb_image_resize.h:   Easy API downsamples w/Mitchell filter, upsamples w/cubic interpolation.
include/stb-master/deprecated/stb_image_resize.h:
include/stb-master/deprecated/stb_image_resize.h:   COMPILING & LINKING
include/stb-master/deprecated/stb_image_resize.h:      In one C/C++ file that #includes this file, do this:
include/stb-master/deprecated/stb_image_resize.h:         #define STB_IMAGE_RESIZE_IMPLEMENTATION
include/stb-master/deprecated/stb_image_resize.h:      before the #include. That will create the implementation in that file.
include/stb-master/deprecated/stb_image_resize.h:
include/stb-master/deprecated/stb_image_resize.h:   QUICKSTART
