include/stb-master/tests/caveview/stb_gl.h:// stbgl - v0.04 - Sean Barrett 2008 - public domain
include/stb-master/tests/caveview/stb_gl.h://
include/stb-master/tests/caveview/stb_gl.h:// Note that the gl extensions support requires glext.h. In fact, it works
include/stb-master/tests/caveview/stb_gl.h:// if you just concatenate glext.h onto the end of this file. In that case,
include/stb-master/tests/caveview/stb_gl.h:// this file is covered by the SGI FreeB license, and is not public domain.
include/stb-master/tests/caveview/stb_gl.h://
include/stb-master/tests/caveview/stb_gl.h:// Extension usage:
include/stb-master/tests/caveview/stb_gl.h://
include/stb-master/tests/caveview/stb_gl.h://    1. Make a file called something like "extlist.txt" which contains stuff like:
include/stb-master/tests/caveview/stb_gl.h://         GLE(ShaderSourceARB,SHADERSOURCEARB)
include/stb-master/tests/caveview/stb_gl.h://         GLE(Uniform1iARB,UNIFORM1IARB)
include/stb-master/tests/caveview/stb_gl.h://         GLARB(ActiveTexture,ACTIVETEXTURE)   // same as GLE(ActiveTextureARB,ACTIVETEXTUREARB)
include/stb-master/tests/caveview/stb_gl.h://         GLARB(ClientActiveTexture,CLIENTACTIVETEXTURE)
include/stb-master/tests/caveview/stb_gl.h://         GLE(MultiTexCoord2f,MULTITEXCOORD2F)
include/stb-master/tests/caveview/stb_gl.h://
include/stb-master/tests/caveview/stb_gl.h://    2. To declare functions (to make a header file), do this:
include/stb-master/tests/caveview/stb_gl.h://         #define STB_GLEXT_DECLARE "extlist.txt"
include/stb-master/tests/caveview/stb_gl.h://         #include "stb_gl.h"
include/stb-master/tests/caveview/stb_gl.h://
include/stb-master/tests/caveview/stb_gl.h://       A good way to do this is to define STB_GLEXT_DECLARE project-wide.
include/stb-master/tests/caveview/stb_gl.h://
include/stb-master/tests/caveview/stb_gl.h://    3. To define functions (implement), do this in some C file:
include/stb-master/tests/caveview/stb_gl.h://         #define STB_GLEXT_DEFINE "extlist.txt"
include/stb-master/tests/caveview/stb_gl.h://         #include "stb_gl.h"
include/stb-master/tests/caveview/stb_gl.h://
include/stb-master/tests/caveview/stb_gl.h://       If you've already defined STB_GLEXT_DECLARE, you can just do:
include/stb-master/tests/caveview/stb_gl.h://         #define STB_GLEXT_DEFINE_DECLARE
include/stb-master/tests/caveview/stb_gl.h://         #include "stb_gl.h"
include/stb-master/tests/caveview/stb_gl.h://
include/stb-master/tests/caveview/stb_gl.h://    4. Now you need to initialize:
include/stb-master/tests/caveview/stb_gl.h://
include/stb-master/tests/caveview/stb_gl.h://         stbgl_initExtensions();
