include/stb-master/tests/caveview/stb_glprog.h://                     or    STBGL_VERTEX_SHADER or STBGL_FRAGMENT_SHADER
include/stb-master/tests/caveview/stb_glprog.h://    sources       array of strings containing the shader source
include/stb-master/tests/caveview/stb_glprog.h://    num_sources   number of string in sources, or -1 meaning sources is NULL-terminated
include/stb-master/tests/caveview/stb_glprog.h://    error         string to output compiler error to
