include/stb-master/stb_include.h:// stb_include.h - v0.02 - parse and process #include directives - public domain
include/stb-master/stb_include.h://
include/stb-master/stb_include.h:// To build this, in one source file that includes this file do
include/stb-master/stb_include.h://      #define STB_INCLUDE_IMPLEMENTATION
include/stb-master/stb_include.h://
include/stb-master/stb_include.h:// This program parses a string and replaces lines of the form
include/stb-master/stb_include.h://         #include "foo"
include/stb-master/stb_include.h:// with the contents of a file named "foo". It also embeds the
include/stb-master/stb_include.h:// appropriate #line directives. Note that all include files must
include/stb-master/stb_include.h:// reside in the location specified in the path passed to the API;
include/stb-master/stb_include.h:// it does not check multiple directories.
include/stb-master/stb_include.h://
include/stb-master/stb_include.h:// If the string contains a line of the form
include/stb-master/stb_include.h://         #inject
include/stb-master/stb_include.h:// then it will be replaced with the contents of the string 'inject' passed to the API.
include/stb-master/stb_include.h://
include/stb-master/stb_include.h:// Options:
include/stb-master/stb_include.h://
include/stb-master/stb_include.h://      Define STB_INCLUDE_LINE_GLSL to get GLSL-style #line directives
include/stb-master/stb_include.h://      which use numbers instead of filenames.
include/stb-master/stb_include.h://
include/stb-master/stb_include.h://      Define STB_INCLUDE_LINE_NONE to disable output of #line directives.
include/stb-master/stb_include.h://
