include/stb-master/stb_c_lexer.h:// stb_c_lexer.h - v0.12 - public domain Sean Barrett 2013
include/stb-master/stb_c_lexer.h:// lexer for making little C-like languages with recursive-descent parsers
include/stb-master/stb_c_lexer.h://
include/stb-master/stb_c_lexer.h:// This file provides both the interface and the implementation.
include/stb-master/stb_c_lexer.h:// To instantiate the implementation,
include/stb-master/stb_c_lexer.h://      #define STB_C_LEXER_IMPLEMENTATION
include/stb-master/stb_c_lexer.h:// in *ONE* source file, before #including this file.
include/stb-master/stb_c_lexer.h://
include/stb-master/stb_c_lexer.h:// The default configuration is fairly close to a C lexer, although
include/stb-master/stb_c_lexer.h:// suffixes on integer constants are not handled (you can override this).
include/stb-master/stb_c_lexer.h://
include/stb-master/stb_c_lexer.h:// History:
include/stb-master/stb_c_lexer.h://     0.12 fix compilation bug for NUL support; better support separate inclusion
include/stb-master/stb_c_lexer.h://     0.11 fix clang static analysis warning
include/stb-master/stb_c_lexer.h://     0.10 fix warnings
include/stb-master/stb_c_lexer.h://     0.09 hex floats, no-stdlib fixes
include/stb-master/stb_c_lexer.h://     0.08 fix bad pointer comparison
include/stb-master/stb_c_lexer.h://     0.07 fix mishandling of hexadecimal constants parsed by strtol
include/stb-master/stb_c_lexer.h://     0.06 fix missing next character after ending quote mark (Andreas Fredriksson)
include/stb-master/stb_c_lexer.h://     0.05 refixed get_location because github version had lost the fix
include/stb-master/stb_c_lexer.h://     0.04 fix octal parsing bug
include/stb-master/stb_c_lexer.h://     0.03 added STB_C_LEX_DISCARD_PREPROCESSOR option
include/stb-master/stb_c_lexer.h://          refactor API to simplify (only one struct instead of two)
include/stb-master/stb_c_lexer.h://          change literal enum names to have 'lit' at the end
include/stb-master/stb_c_lexer.h://     0.02 first public release
include/stb-master/stb_c_lexer.h://
include/stb-master/stb_c_lexer.h:// Status:
include/stb-master/stb_c_lexer.h://     - haven't tested compiling as C++
include/stb-master/stb_c_lexer.h://     - haven't tested the float parsing path
include/stb-master/stb_c_lexer.h://     - haven't tested the non-default-config paths (e.g. non-stdlib)
include/stb-master/stb_c_lexer.h://     - only tested default-config paths by eyeballing output of self-parse
include/stb-master/stb_c_lexer.h://
include/stb-master/stb_c_lexer.h://     - haven't implemented multiline strings
include/stb-master/stb_c_lexer.h://     - haven't implemented octal/hex character constants
include/stb-master/stb_c_lexer.h://     - haven't implemented support for unicode CLEX_char
include/stb-master/stb_c_lexer.h://     - need to expand error reporting so you don't just get "CLEX_parse_error"
include/stb-master/stb_c_lexer.h://
include/stb-master/stb_c_lexer.h:// Contributors:
include/stb-master/stb_c_lexer.h://   Arpad Goretity (bugfix)
include/stb-master/stb_c_lexer.h://   Alan Hickman (hex floats)
include/stb-master/stb_c_lexer.h://   github:mundusnine (bugfix)
