include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h:== WHAT IT IS ===========================
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h:
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h: This library is an SDK for Herringbone Wang Tile generation:
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h:
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h:      http://nothings.org/gamedev/herringbone
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h:
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h: The core design is that you use this library offline to generate a
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h: "template" of the tiles you'll create. You then edit those tiles, then
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h: load the created tile image file back into this library and use it at
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h: runtime to generate "maps".
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h:
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h: You cannot load arbitrary tile image files with this library; it is
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h: only designed to load image files made from the template it created.
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h: It stores a binary description of the tile sizes & constraints in a
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h: few pixels, and uses those to recover the rules, rather than trying
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h: to parse the tiles themselves.
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h:
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h: You *can* use this library to generate from arbitrary tile sets, but
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h: only by loading the tile set and specifying the constraints explicitly
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h: yourself.
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h:
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h:== COMPILING ============================
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h:
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h: 1. #define STB_HERRINGBONE_WANG_TILE_IMPLEMENTATION before including this
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h:    header file in *one* source file to create the implementation
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h:    in that source file.
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h:
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h: 2. optionally #define STB_HBWANG_RAND() to be a random number
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h:    generator. if you don't define it, it will use rand(),
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h:    and you need to seed srand() yourself.
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h:
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h: 3. optionally #define STB_HBWANG_ASSERT(x), otherwise
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h:    it will use assert()
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h:
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h: 4. optionally #define STB_HBWANG_STATIC to force all symbols to be
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h:    static instead of public, so they are only accesible
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h:    in the source file that creates the implementation
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h:
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h: 5. optionally #define STB_HBWANG_NO_REPITITION_REDUCTION to disable
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h:    the code that tries to reduce having the same tile appear
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h:    adjacent to itself in wang-corner-tile mode (e.g. imagine
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h:    if you were doing something where 90% of things should be
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h:    the same grass tile, you need to disable this system)
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h:
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h: 6. optionally define STB_HBWANG_MAX_X and STB_HBWANG_MAX_Y
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h:    to be the max dimensions of the generated map in multiples
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h:    of the wang tile's short side's length (e.g. if you
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h:    have 20x10 wang tiles, so short_side_len=10, and you
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h:    have MAX_X is 17, then the largest map you can generate
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h:    is 170 pixels wide). The defaults are 100x100. This
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h:    is used to define static arrays which affect memory
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h:    usage.
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h:
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h:== USING ================================
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h:
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h:  To use the map generator, you need a tileset. You can download
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h:  some sample tilesets from http://nothings.org/gamedev/herringbone
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h:
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h:  Then see the "sample application" below.
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h:
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h:  You can also use this file to generate templates for
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h:  tilesets which you then hand-edit to create the data.
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h:
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h:
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h:== MEMORY MANAGEMENT ====================
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h:
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h:  The tileset loader allocates memory with malloc(). The map
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h:  generator does no memory allocation, so e.g. you can load
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h:  tilesets at startup and never free them and never do any
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h:  further allocation.
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h:
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h:
include/stb-master/stb_herringbone_wang_tile.h:== SAMPLE APPLICATION ===================
