include/stb-master/stb_rect_pack.h:// stb_rect_pack.h - v1.01 - public domain - rectangle packing
include/stb-master/stb_rect_pack.h:// Sean Barrett 2014
include/stb-master/stb_rect_pack.h://
include/stb-master/stb_rect_pack.h:// Useful for e.g. packing rectangular textures into an atlas.
include/stb-master/stb_rect_pack.h:// Does not do rotation.
include/stb-master/stb_rect_pack.h://
include/stb-master/stb_rect_pack.h:// Before #including,
include/stb-master/stb_rect_pack.h://
include/stb-master/stb_rect_pack.h://    #define STB_RECT_PACK_IMPLEMENTATION
include/stb-master/stb_rect_pack.h://
include/stb-master/stb_rect_pack.h:// in the file that you want to have the implementation.
include/stb-master/stb_rect_pack.h://
include/stb-master/stb_rect_pack.h:// Not necessarily the awesomest packing method, but better than
include/stb-master/stb_rect_pack.h:// the totally naive one in stb_truetype (which is primarily what
include/stb-master/stb_rect_pack.h:// this is meant to replace).
include/stb-master/stb_rect_pack.h://
include/stb-master/stb_rect_pack.h:// Has only had a few tests run, may have issues.
include/stb-master/stb_rect_pack.h://
include/stb-master/stb_rect_pack.h:// More docs to come.
include/stb-master/stb_rect_pack.h://
include/stb-master/stb_rect_pack.h:// No memory allocations; uses qsort() and assert() from stdlib.
include/stb-master/stb_rect_pack.h:// Can override those by defining STBRP_SORT and STBRP_ASSERT.
include/stb-master/stb_rect_pack.h://
include/stb-master/stb_rect_pack.h:// This library currently uses the Skyline Bottom-Left algorithm.
include/stb-master/stb_rect_pack.h://
include/stb-master/stb_rect_pack.h:// Please note: better rectangle packers are welcome! Please
include/stb-master/stb_rect_pack.h:// implement them to the same API, but with a different init
include/stb-master/stb_rect_pack.h:// function.
include/stb-master/stb_rect_pack.h://
