include/stb-master/stb_rect_pack.h://
include/stb-master/stb_rect_pack.h://     1.01  (2021-07-11)  always use large rect mode, expose STBRP__MAXVAL in public section
include/stb-master/stb_rect_pack.h://     1.00  (2019-02-25)  avoid small space waste; gracefully fail too-wide rectangles
include/stb-master/stb_rect_pack.h://     0.99  (2019-02-07)  warning fixes
include/stb-master/stb_rect_pack.h://     0.11  (2017-03-03)  return packing success/fail result
include/stb-master/stb_rect_pack.h://     0.10  (2016-10-25)  remove cast-away-const to avoid warnings
include/stb-master/stb_rect_pack.h://     0.09  (2016-08-27)  fix compiler warnings
include/stb-master/stb_rect_pack.h://     0.08  (2015-09-13)  really fix bug with empty rects (w=0 or h=0)
include/stb-master/stb_rect_pack.h://     0.07  (2015-09-13)  fix bug with empty rects (w=0 or h=0)
include/stb-master/stb_rect_pack.h://     0.06  (2015-04-15)  added STBRP_SORT to allow replacing qsort
include/stb-master/stb_rect_pack.h://     0.05:  added STBRP_ASSERT to allow replacing assert
include/stb-master/stb_rect_pack.h://     0.04:  fixed minor bug in STBRP_LARGE_RECTS support
include/stb-master/stb_rect_pack.h://     0.01:  initial release
