include/stb-master/stb_tilemap_editor.h://  save/load
include/stb-master/stb_tilemap_editor.h://
include/stb-master/stb_tilemap_editor.h://  There is no editor file format. You have to save and load the data yourself
include/stb-master/stb_tilemap_editor.h://  through the following functions. You can also use these functions to get the
include/stb-master/stb_tilemap_editor.h://  data to generate game-formatted levels directly. (But make sure you save
include/stb-master/stb_tilemap_editor.h://  first! You may also want to autosave to a temp file periodically, etc etc.)
