include/stb-master/stb_image_resize_test/old_image_resize.h:// This extends the easy-to-use API as follows:
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize_test/old_image_resize.h://
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize_test/old_image_resize.h://     * Alpha-channel can be processed separately
