include/stb-master/stb_image_resize_test/old_image_resize.h://         * Filters will be weighted by alpha channel (unless flags&STBIR_FLAG_ALPHA_PREMULTIPLIED)
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize_test/old_image_resize.h://     * Filter can be selected explicitly
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize_test/old_image_resize.h://     * uint16 image type
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize_test/old_image_resize.h://     * sRGB colorspace available for all types
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize_test/old_image_resize.h://     * context parameter for passing to STBIR_MALLOC
