include/stb-master/stb_image_resize_test/old_image_resize.h://////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize_test/old_image_resize.h://
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize_test/old_image_resize.h:// Full-complexity API
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize_test/old_image_resize.h://
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize_test/old_image_resize.h:// This extends the medium API as follows:
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize_test/old_image_resize.h://
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize_test/old_image_resize.h://       * uint32 image type
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize_test/old_image_resize.h://     * not typesafe
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize_test/old_image_resize.h://     * separate filter types for each axis
