include/stb-master/stb_image.h:RECENT REVISION HISTORY:
include/stb-master/stb_image.h:
include/stb-master/stb_image.h:      2.30  (2024-05-31) avoid erroneous gcc warning
include/stb-master/stb_image.h:      2.29  (2023-05-xx) optimizations
include/stb-master/stb_image.h:      2.28  (2023-01-29) many error fixes, security errors, just tons of stuff
include/stb-master/stb_image.h:      2.27  (2021-07-11) document stbi_info better, 16-bit PNM support, bug fixes
include/stb-master/stb_image.h:      2.26  (2020-07-13) many minor fixes
include/stb-master/stb_image.h:      2.25  (2020-02-02) fix warnings
include/stb-master/stb_image.h:      2.24  (2020-02-02) fix warnings; thread-local failure_reason and flip_vertically
include/stb-master/stb_image.h:      2.23  (2019-08-11) fix clang static analysis warning
include/stb-master/stb_image.h:      2.22  (2019-03-04) gif fixes, fix warnings
include/stb-master/stb_image.h:      2.21  (2019-02-25) fix typo in comment
include/stb-master/stb_image.h:      2.20  (2019-02-07) support utf8 filenames in Windows; fix warnings and platform ifdefs
include/stb-master/stb_image.h:      2.19  (2018-02-11) fix warning
include/stb-master/stb_image.h:      2.18  (2018-01-30) fix warnings
include/stb-master/stb_image.h:      2.17  (2018-01-29) bugfix, 1-bit BMP, 16-bitness query, fix warnings
include/stb-master/stb_image.h:      2.16  (2017-07-23) all functions have 16-bit variants; optimizations; bugfixes
include/stb-master/stb_image.h:      2.15  (2017-03-18) fix png-1,2,4; all Imagenet JPGs; no runtime SSE detection on GCC
include/stb-master/stb_image.h:      2.14  (2017-03-03) remove deprecated STBI_JPEG_OLD; fixes for Imagenet JPGs
include/stb-master/stb_image.h:      2.13  (2016-12-04) experimental 16-bit API, only for PNG so far; fixes
include/stb-master/stb_image.h:      2.12  (2016-04-02) fix typo in 2.11 PSD fix that caused crashes
include/stb-master/stb_image.h:      2.11  (2016-04-02) 16-bit PNGS; enable SSE2 in non-gcc x64
include/stb-master/stb_image.h:                         RGB-format JPEG; remove white matting in PSD;
include/stb-master/stb_image.h:                         allocate large structures on the stack;
include/stb-master/stb_image.h:                         correct channel count for PNG & BMP
include/stb-master/stb_image.h:      2.10  (2016-01-22) avoid warning introduced in 2.09
include/stb-master/stb_image.h:      2.09  (2016-01-16) 16-bit TGA; comments in PNM files; STBI_REALLOC_SIZED
