include/stb-master/stb_image.h:#define STBI__MARKER_none  0xff
include/stb-master/stb_image.h:// if there's a pending marker from the entropy stream, return that
include/stb-master/stb_image.h:// otherwise, fetch from the stream and get a marker. if there's no
include/stb-master/stb_image.h:// marker, return 0xff, which is never a valid marker value
