include/stb-master/stb_image.h:// public domain zlib decode    v0.2  Sean Barrett 2006-11-18
include/stb-master/stb_image.h://    simple implementation
include/stb-master/stb_image.h://      - all input must be provided in an upfront buffer
include/stb-master/stb_image.h://      - all output is written to a single output buffer (can malloc/realloc)
include/stb-master/stb_image.h://    performance
include/stb-master/stb_image.h://      - fast huffman
