include/stb-master/stb_image.h:
include/stb-master/stb_image.h:// zlib-from-memory implementation for PNG reading
include/stb-master/stb_image.h://    because PNG allows splitting the zlib stream arbitrarily,
include/stb-master/stb_image.h://    and it's annoying structurally to have PNG call ZLIB call PNG,
include/stb-master/stb_image.h://    we require PNG read all the IDATs and combine them into a single
include/stb-master/stb_image.h://    memory buffer
