include/stb-master/stb_image.h:// public domain "baseline" PNG decoder   v0.10  Sean Barrett 2006-11-18
include/stb-master/stb_image.h://    simple implementation
include/stb-master/stb_image.h://      - only 8-bit samples
include/stb-master/stb_image.h://      - no CRC checking
include/stb-master/stb_image.h://      - allocates lots of intermediate memory
include/stb-master/stb_image.h://        - avoids problem of streaming data between subsystems
include/stb-master/stb_image.h://        - avoids explicit window management
include/stb-master/stb_image.h://    performance
include/stb-master/stb_image.h://      - uses stb_zlib, a PD zlib implementation with fast huffman decoding
