include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h:// =======================================================================
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://    NO SECURITY GUARANTEE -- DO NOT USE THIS ON UNTRUSTED FONT FILES
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h:// This library does no range checking of the offsets found in the file,
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h:// meaning an attacker can use it to read arbitrary memory.
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h:// =======================================================================
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://   This library processes TrueType files:
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://        parse files
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://        extract glyph metrics
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://        extract glyph shapes
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://        render glyphs to one-channel bitmaps with antialiasing (box filter)
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://        render glyphs to one-channel SDF bitmaps (signed-distance field/function)
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://   Todo:
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://        non-MS cmaps
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://        crashproof on bad data
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://        hinting? (no longer patented)
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://        cleartype-style AA?
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://        optimize: use simple memory allocator for intermediates
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://        optimize: build edge-list directly from curves
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://        optimize: rasterize directly from curves?
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://
