include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h:// if return is positive, the first unused row of the bitmap
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h:// if return is negative, returns the negative of the number of characters that fit
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h:// if return is 0, no characters fit and no rows were used
