include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h:// Call GetBakedQuad with char_index = 'character - first_char', and it
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h:// creates the quad you need to draw and advances the current position.
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h:// The coordinate system used assumes y increases downwards.
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h:// Characters will extend both above and below the current position;
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h:// see discussion of "BASELINE" above.
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://
