include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h:// leftSideBearing is the offset from the current horizontal position to the left edge of the character
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h:// advanceWidth is the offset from the current horizontal position to the next horizontal position
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://   these are expressed in unscaled coordinates
