include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h:// in the form of 'output', with row spacing of 'out_stride' bytes. the bitmap
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h:// is clipped to out_w/out_h bytes. Call stbtt_GetCodepointBitmapBox to get the
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h:// width and height and positioning info for it first.
