include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h:// get the bbox of the bitmap centered around the glyph origin; so the
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h:// bitmap width is ix1-ix0, height is iy1-iy0, and location to place
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h:// the bitmap top left is (leftSideBearing*scale,iy0).
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h:// (Note that the bitmap uses y-increases-down, but the shape uses
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h:// y-increases-up, so CodepointBitmapBox and CodepointBox are inverted.)
