include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h:// FULL VERSION HISTORY
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://   1.25 (2021-07-11) many fixes
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://   1.24 (2020-02-05) fix warning
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://   1.23 (2020-02-02) query SVG data for glyphs; query whole kerning table (but only kern not GPOS)
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://   1.22 (2019-08-11) minimize missing-glyph duplication; fix kerning if both 'GPOS' and 'kern' are defined
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://   1.21 (2019-02-25) fix warning
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://   1.20 (2019-02-07) PackFontRange skips missing codepoints; GetScaleFontVMetrics()
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://   1.19 (2018-02-11) OpenType GPOS kerning (horizontal only), STBTT_fmod
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://   1.18 (2018-01-29) add missing function
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://   1.17 (2017-07-23) make more arguments const; doc fix
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://   1.16 (2017-07-12) SDF support
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://   1.15 (2017-03-03) make more arguments const
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://   1.14 (2017-01-16) num-fonts-in-TTC function
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://   1.13 (2017-01-02) support OpenType fonts, certain Apple fonts
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://   1.12 (2016-10-25) suppress warnings about casting away const with -Wcast-qual
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://   1.11 (2016-04-02) fix unused-variable warning
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://   1.10 (2016-04-02) allow user-defined fabs() replacement
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://                     fix memory leak if fontsize=0.0
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://                     fix warning from duplicate typedef
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://   1.09 (2016-01-16) warning fix; avoid crash on outofmem; use alloc userdata for PackFontRanges
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://   1.08 (2015-09-13) document stbtt_Rasterize(); fixes for vertical & horizontal edges
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://   1.07 (2015-08-01) allow PackFontRanges to accept arrays of sparse codepoints;
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://                     allow PackFontRanges to pack and render in separate phases;
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://                     fix stbtt_GetFontOFfsetForIndex (never worked for non-0 input?);
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://                     fixed an assert() bug in the new rasterizer
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://                     replace assert() with STBTT_assert() in new rasterizer
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://   1.06 (2015-07-14) performance improvements (~35% faster on x86 and x64 on test machine)
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://                     also more precise AA rasterizer, except if shapes overlap
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://                     remove need for STBTT_sort
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://   1.05 (2015-04-15) fix misplaced definitions for STBTT_STATIC
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://   1.04 (2015-04-15) typo in example
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://   1.03 (2015-04-12) STBTT_STATIC, fix memory leak in new packing, various fixes
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://   1.02 (2014-12-10) fix various warnings & compile issues w/ stb_rect_pack, C++
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://   1.01 (2014-12-08) fix subpixel position when oversampling to exactly match
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://                        non-oversampled; STBTT_POINT_SIZE for packed case only
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://   1.00 (2014-12-06) add new PackBegin etc. API, w/ support for oversampling
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://   0.99 (2014-09-18) fix multiple bugs with subpixel rendering (ryg)
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://   0.9  (2014-08-07) support certain mac/iOS fonts without an MS platformID
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://   0.8b (2014-07-07) fix a warning
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://   0.8  (2014-05-25) fix a few more warnings
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://   0.7  (2013-09-25) bugfix: subpixel glyph bug fixed in 0.5 had come back
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://   0.6c (2012-07-24) improve documentation
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://   0.6b (2012-07-20) fix a few more warnings
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://   0.6  (2012-07-17) fix warnings; added stbtt_ScaleForMappingEmToPixels,
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://                        stbtt_GetFontBoundingBox, stbtt_IsGlyphEmpty
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://   0.5  (2011-12-09) bugfixes:
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://                        subpixel glyph renderer computed wrong bounding box
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://                        first vertex of shape can be off-curve (FreeSans)
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://   0.4b (2011-12-03) fixed an error in the font baking example
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://   0.4  (2011-12-01) kerning, subpixel rendering (tor)
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://                    bugfixes for:
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://                        codepoint-to-glyph conversion using table fmt=12
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://                        codepoint-to-glyph conversion using table fmt=4
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://                        stbtt_GetBakedQuad with non-square texture (Zer)
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://                    updated Hello World! sample to use kerning and subpixel
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://                    fixed some warnings
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://   0.3  (2009-06-24) cmap fmt=12, compound shapes (MM)
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://                    userdata, malloc-from-userdata, non-zero fill (stb)
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://   0.2  (2009-03-11) Fix unsigned/signed char warnings
include/stb-master/stb_truetype.h://   0.1  (2009-03-09) First public release
