include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h:      Jeff Roberts: 2.0 implementation, optimizations, SIMD
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h:      Martins Mozeiko: NEON simd, WASM simd, clang and GCC whisperer
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h:      Fabian Giesen: half float and srgb converters
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h:      Sean Barrett: API design, optimizations
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h:      Jorge L Rodriguez: Original 1.0 implementation
