include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h:
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h:   REVISIONS
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h:      2.17 (2025-10-25) silly format bug in easy-to-use APIs.
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h:      2.16 (2025-10-21) fixed the easy-to-use APIs to allow inverted bitmaps (negative
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h:                          strides), fix vertical filter kernel callback, fix threaded
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h:                          gather buffer priming (and assert).
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h:                          (thanks adipose, TainZerL, and Harrison Green)
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h:      2.15 (2025-07-17) fixed an assert in debug mode when using floats with input
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h:                          callbacks, work around GCC warning when adding to null ptr
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h:                          (thanks Johannes Spohr and Pyry Kovanen).
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h:      2.14 (2025-05-09) fixed a bug using downsampling gather horizontal first, and 
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h:                          scatter with vertical first.
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h:      2.13 (2025-02-27) fixed a bug when using input callbacks, turned off simd for 
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h:                          tiny-c, fixed some variables that should have been static,
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h:                          fixes a bug when calculating temp memory with resizes that
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h:                          exceed 2GB of temp memory (very large resizes).
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h:      2.12 (2024-10-18) fix incorrect use of user_data with STBIR_FREE
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h:      2.11 (2024-09-08) fix harmless asan warnings in 2-channel and 3-channel mode
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h:                          with AVX-2, fix some weird scaling edge conditions with
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h:                          point sample mode.
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h:      2.10 (2024-07-27) fix the defines GCC and mingw for loop unroll control,
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h:                          fix MSVC 32-bit arm half float routines.
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h:      2.09 (2024-06-19) fix the defines for 32-bit ARM GCC builds (was selecting
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h:                          hardware half floats).
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h:      2.08 (2024-06-10) fix for RGB->BGR three channel flips and add SIMD (thanks
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h:                          to Ryan Salsbury), fix for sub-rect resizes, use the
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h:                          pragmas to control unrolling when they are available.
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h:      2.07 (2024-05-24) fix for slow final split during threaded conversions of very 
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h:                          wide scanlines when downsampling (caused by extra input 
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h:                          converting), fix for wide scanline resamples with many 
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h:                          splits (int overflow), fix GCC warning.
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h:      2.06 (2024-02-10) fix for identical width/height 3x or more down-scaling 
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h:                          undersampling a single row on rare resize ratios (about 1%).
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h:      2.05 (2024-02-07) fix for 2 pixel to 1 pixel resizes with wrap (thanks Aras),
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h:                        fix for output callback (thanks Julien Koenen).
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h:      2.04 (2023-11-17) fix for rare AVX bug, shadowed symbol (thanks Nikola Smiljanic).
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h:      2.03 (2023-11-01) ASAN and TSAN warnings fixed, minor tweaks.
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h:      2.00 (2023-10-10) mostly new source: new api, optimizations, simd, vertical-first, etc
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h:                          2x-5x faster without simd, 4x-12x faster with simd,
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h:                          in some cases, 20x to 40x faster esp resizing large to very small.
