include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h:// Easy-to-use API:
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h://
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h://     * stride is the offset between successive rows of image data
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h://        in memory, in bytes. specify 0 for packed continuously in memory
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h://     * colorspace is linear or sRGB as specified by function name
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h://     * Uses the default filters
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h://     * Uses edge mode clamped
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h://     * returned result is 1 for success or 0 in case of an error.
