include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h:
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h:
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h:
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h://===============================================================
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h:// Extended-complexity API
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h://
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h:// This API exposes all resize functionality.
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h://
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h://     * Separate filter types for each axis
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h://     * Separate edge modes for each axis
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h://     * Separate input and output data types
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h://     * Can specify regions with subpixel correctness
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h://     * Can specify alpha flags
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h://     * Can specify a memory callback
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h://     * Can specify a callback data type for pixel input and output
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h://     * Can be threaded for a single resize
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h://     * Can be used to resize many frames without recalculating the sampler info
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h://
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h://  Use this API as follows:
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h://     1) Call the stbir_resize_init function on a local STBIR_RESIZE structure
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h://     2) Call any of the stbir_set functions
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h://     3) Optionally call stbir_build_samplers() if you are going to resample multiple times
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h://        with the same input and output dimensions (like resizing video frames)
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h://     4) Resample by calling stbir_resize_extended().
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h://     5) Call stbir_free_samplers() if you called stbir_build_samplers()
include/stb-master/stb_image_resize2.h://--------------------------------
