include/stb-master/stb_perlin.h:// not same permutation table as Perlin's reference to avoid copyright issues;
include/stb-master/stb_perlin.h:// Perlin's table can be found at http://mrl.nyu.edu/~perlin/noise/
include/stb-master/stb_perlin.h:static unsigned char stb__perlin_randtab[512] =
