include/stb-master/stb_textedit.h:// stb_textedit.h - v1.14  - public domain - Sean Barrett
include/stb-master/stb_textedit.h:// Development of this library was sponsored by RAD Game Tools
include/stb-master/stb_textedit.h://
include/stb-master/stb_textedit.h:// This C header file implements the guts of a multi-line text-editing
include/stb-master/stb_textedit.h:// widget; you implement display, word-wrapping, and low-level string
include/stb-master/stb_textedit.h:// insertion/deletion, and stb_textedit will map user inputs into
include/stb-master/stb_textedit.h:// insertions & deletions, plus updates to the cursor position,
include/stb-master/stb_textedit.h:// selection state, and undo state.
include/stb-master/stb_textedit.h://
include/stb-master/stb_textedit.h:// It is intended for use in games and other systems that need to build
include/stb-master/stb_textedit.h:// their own custom widgets and which do not have heavy text-editing
include/stb-master/stb_textedit.h:// requirements (this library is not recommended for use for editing large
include/stb-master/stb_textedit.h:// texts, as its performance does not scale and it has limited undo).
include/stb-master/stb_textedit.h://
include/stb-master/stb_textedit.h:// Non-trivial behaviors are modelled after Windows text controls.
include/stb-master/stb_textedit.h://
include/stb-master/stb_textedit.h://
include/stb-master/stb_textedit.h:// LICENSE
include/stb-master/stb_textedit.h://
include/stb-master/stb_textedit.h:// See end of file for license information.
include/stb-master/stb_textedit.h://
include/stb-master/stb_textedit.h://
include/stb-master/stb_textedit.h:// DEPENDENCIES
include/stb-master/stb_textedit.h://
include/stb-master/stb_textedit.h:// Uses the C runtime function 'memmove', which you can override
include/stb-master/stb_textedit.h:// by defining STB_TEXTEDIT_memmove before the implementation.
include/stb-master/stb_textedit.h:// Uses no other functions. Performs no runtime allocations.
include/stb-master/stb_textedit.h://
include/stb-master/stb_textedit.h://
include/stb-master/stb_textedit.h:// VERSION HISTORY
include/stb-master/stb_textedit.h://
include/stb-master/stb_textedit.h://   1.14 (2021-07-11) page up/down, various fixes
include/stb-master/stb_textedit.h://   1.13 (2019-02-07) fix bug in undo size management
include/stb-master/stb_textedit.h://   1.12 (2018-01-29) user can change STB_TEXTEDIT_KEYTYPE, fix redo to avoid crash
include/stb-master/stb_textedit.h://   1.11 (2017-03-03) fix HOME on last line, dragging off single-line textfield
include/stb-master/stb_textedit.h://   1.10 (2016-10-25) supress warnings about casting away const with -Wcast-qual
include/stb-master/stb_textedit.h://   1.9  (2016-08-27) customizable move-by-word
include/stb-master/stb_textedit.h://   1.8  (2016-04-02) better keyboard handling when mouse button is down
include/stb-master/stb_textedit.h://   1.7  (2015-09-13) change y range handling in case baseline is non-0
include/stb-master/stb_textedit.h://   1.6  (2015-04-15) allow STB_TEXTEDIT_memmove
include/stb-master/stb_textedit.h://   1.5  (2014-09-10) add support for secondary keys for OS X
include/stb-master/stb_textedit.h://   1.4  (2014-08-17) fix signed/unsigned warnings
include/stb-master/stb_textedit.h://   1.3  (2014-06-19) fix mouse clicking to round to nearest char boundary
include/stb-master/stb_textedit.h://   1.2  (2014-05-27) fix some RAD types that had crept into the new code
include/stb-master/stb_textedit.h://   1.1  (2013-12-15) move-by-word (requires STB_TEXTEDIT_IS_SPACE )
include/stb-master/stb_textedit.h://   1.0  (2012-07-26) improve documentation, initial public release
include/stb-master/stb_textedit.h://   0.3  (2012-02-24) bugfixes, single-line mode; insert mode
include/stb-master/stb_textedit.h://   0.2  (2011-11-28) fixes to undo/redo
include/stb-master/stb_textedit.h://   0.1  (2010-07-08) initial version
include/stb-master/stb_textedit.h://
include/stb-master/stb_textedit.h:// ADDITIONAL CONTRIBUTORS
include/stb-master/stb_textedit.h://
