include/stb-master/stb_voxel_render.h:// The following are candidate voxel modes. Only modes 0, 1, and 20, and 21 are
include/stb-master/stb_voxel_render.h:// currently implemented. Reducing the storage-per-quad further
include/stb-master/stb_voxel_render.h:// shouldn't improve performance, although obviously it allow you
include/stb-master/stb_voxel_render.h:// to create larger worlds without streaming.
include/stb-master/stb_voxel_render.h://
include/stb-master/stb_voxel_render.h://
include/stb-master/stb_voxel_render.h://                      -----------  Two textures -----------       -- One texture --     ---- Color only ----
include/stb-master/stb_voxel_render.h://            Mode:     0     1     2     3     4     5     6        10    11    12      20    21    22    23    24
include/stb-master/stb_voxel_render.h:// ============================================================================================================
include/stb-master/stb_voxel_render.h://  uses Tex Buffer     n     Y     Y     Y     Y     Y     Y         Y     Y     Y       n     Y     Y     Y     Y
include/stb-master/stb_voxel_render.h://   bytes per quad    32    20    14    12    10     6     6         8     8     4      32    20    10     6     4
include/stb-master/stb_voxel_render.h://       non-blocks   all   all   some  some  some slabs stairs     some  some  none    all   all  slabs slabs  none
include/stb-master/stb_voxel_render.h://             tex1   256   256   256   256   256   256   256       256   256   256       n     n     n     n     n
include/stb-master/stb_voxel_render.h://             tex2   256   256   256   256   256   256   128         n     n     n       n     n     n     n     n
include/stb-master/stb_voxel_render.h://           colors    64    64    64    64    64    64    64         8     n     n     2^24  2^24  2^24  2^24  256
include/stb-master/stb_voxel_render.h://        vertex ao     Y     Y     Y     Y     Y     n     n         Y     Y     n       Y     Y     Y     n     n
include/stb-master/stb_voxel_render.h://   vertex texlerp     Y     Y     Y     n     n     n     n         -     -     -       -     -     -     -     -
include/stb-master/stb_voxel_render.h://      x&y extents   127   127   128    64    64   128    64        64   128   128     127   127   128   128   128
include/stb-master/stb_voxel_render.h://        z extents   255   255   128    64?   64?   64    64        32    64   128     255   255   128    64   128
