include/stb-master/stb_voxel_render.h://   - API for texture rotation on top & bottom
include/stb-master/stb_voxel_render.h://   - better culling of vheight faces with vheight neighbors
include/stb-master/stb_voxel_render.h://   - better culling of non-vheight faces with vheight neighbors
include/stb-master/stb_voxel_render.h://   - gather vertex lighting from slopes correctly
include/stb-master/stb_voxel_render.h://   - better support texture edge_clamp: currently if you fall
include/stb-master/stb_voxel_render.h://     exactly on 1.0 you get wrapped incorrectly; this is rare, but
include/stb-master/stb_voxel_render.h://     can avoid: compute texcoords in vertex shader, offset towards
include/stb-master/stb_voxel_render.h://     center before modding, need 2 bits per vertex to know offset direction)
