include/tinyobjloader/tiny_obj_loader.h://
include/tinyobjloader/tiny_obj_loader.h:// version 2.0.0 : Add new object oriented API. 1.x API is still provided.
include/tinyobjloader/tiny_obj_loader.h://                 * Add python binding.
include/tinyobjloader/tiny_obj_loader.h://                 * Support line primitive.
include/tinyobjloader/tiny_obj_loader.h://                 * Support points primitive.
include/tinyobjloader/tiny_obj_loader.h://                 * Support multiple search path for .mtl(v1 API).
include/tinyobjloader/tiny_obj_loader.h://                 * Support vertex skinning weight `vw`(as an tinyobj
include/tinyobjloader/tiny_obj_loader.h://                 extension). Note that this differs vertex weight([w]
include/tinyobjloader/tiny_obj_loader.h://                 component in `v` line)
include/tinyobjloader/tiny_obj_loader.h://                 * Support escaped whitespece in mtllib
include/tinyobjloader/tiny_obj_loader.h://                 * Add robust triangulation using Mapbox
include/tinyobjloader/tiny_obj_loader.h://                 earcut(TINYOBJLOADER_USE_MAPBOX_EARCUT).
include/tinyobjloader/tiny_obj_loader.h:// version 1.4.0 : Modifed ParseTextureNameAndOption API
include/tinyobjloader/tiny_obj_loader.h:// version 1.3.1 : Make ParseTextureNameAndOption API public
include/tinyobjloader/tiny_obj_loader.h:// version 1.3.0 : Separate warning and error message(breaking API of LoadObj)
include/tinyobjloader/tiny_obj_loader.h:// version 1.2.3 : Added color space extension('-colorspace') to tex opts.
include/tinyobjloader/tiny_obj_loader.h:// version 1.2.2 : Parse multiple group names.
include/tinyobjloader/tiny_obj_loader.h:// version 1.2.1 : Added initial support for line('l') primitive(PR #178)
include/tinyobjloader/tiny_obj_loader.h:// version 1.2.0 : Hardened implementation(#175)
include/tinyobjloader/tiny_obj_loader.h:// version 1.1.1 : Support smoothing groups(#162)
include/tinyobjloader/tiny_obj_loader.h:// version 1.1.0 : Support parsing vertex color(#144)
include/tinyobjloader/tiny_obj_loader.h:// version 1.0.8 : Fix parsing `g` tag just after `usemtl`(#138)
include/tinyobjloader/tiny_obj_loader.h:// version 1.0.7 : Support multiple tex options(#126)
include/tinyobjloader/tiny_obj_loader.h:// version 1.0.6 : Add TINYOBJLOADER_USE_DOUBLE option(#124)
include/tinyobjloader/tiny_obj_loader.h:// version 1.0.5 : Ignore `Tr` when `d` exists in MTL(#43)
include/tinyobjloader/tiny_obj_loader.h:// version 1.0.4 : Support multiple filenames for 'mtllib'(#112)
include/tinyobjloader/tiny_obj_loader.h:// version 1.0.3 : Support parsing texture options(#85)
include/tinyobjloader/tiny_obj_loader.h:// version 1.0.2 : Improve parsing speed by about a factor of 2 for large
include/tinyobjloader/tiny_obj_loader.h:// files(#105)
include/tinyobjloader/tiny_obj_loader.h:// version 1.0.1 : Fixes a shape is lost if obj ends with a 'usemtl'(#104)
include/tinyobjloader/tiny_obj_loader.h:// version 1.0.0 : Change data structure. Change license from BSD to MIT.
