include/tinyobjloader/tiny_obj_loader.h:/// Loads .obj from a file.
include/tinyobjloader/tiny_obj_loader.h:/// 'attrib', 'shapes' and 'materials' will be filled with parsed shape data
include/tinyobjloader/tiny_obj_loader.h:/// 'shapes' will be filled with parsed shape data
include/tinyobjloader/tiny_obj_loader.h:/// Returns true when loading .obj become success.
include/tinyobjloader/tiny_obj_loader.h:/// Returns warning message into `warn`, and error message into `err`
include/tinyobjloader/tiny_obj_loader.h:/// 'mtl_basedir' is optional, and used for base directory for .mtl file.
include/tinyobjloader/tiny_obj_loader.h:/// In default(`NULL'), .mtl file is searched from an application's working
include/tinyobjloader/tiny_obj_loader.h:/// directory.
include/tinyobjloader/tiny_obj_loader.h:/// 'triangulate' is optional, and used whether triangulate polygon face in .obj
include/tinyobjloader/tiny_obj_loader.h:/// or not.
include/tinyobjloader/tiny_obj_loader.h:/// Option 'default_vcols_fallback' specifies whether vertex colors should
include/tinyobjloader/tiny_obj_loader.h:/// always be defined, even if no colors are given (fallback to white).
