include/tinyobjloader/tiny_obj_loader.h:/// `callback.mtllib_cb`.
include/tinyobjloader/tiny_obj_loader.h:/// Returns true when loading .obj/.mtl become success.
include/tinyobjloader/tiny_obj_loader.h:/// Returns warning message into `warn`, and error message into `err`
include/tinyobjloader/tiny_obj_loader.h:/// See `examples/callback_api/` for how to use this function.
